# Предупреждения по ключам AmneziaWG
M_en_EGRESS_W_VLESS_INSECURE='Key #%s: VLESS without a certificate check (allowInsecure) — the certificate fingerprint couldn’t be taken, the exit doesn’t work. Update the key or the subscription: it needs a link with the pcs fingerprint.'
M_en_EGRESS_TOFU_PINNED='Key without a certificate check (%s): the certificate fingerprint was taken and pinned automatically — the exit keeps working.'
M_en_EGRESS_TOFU_FAILED='Key without a certificate check (%s): the server didn’t answer — the certificate fingerprint couldn’t be taken, the exit doesn’t work yet. Kaskad will try again by itself, at most once an hour (for up to 7 days).'
M_en_EGRESS_TOFU_VERIFIED='Key without a certificate check (%s): the server’s certificate checks out against the trusted roots — the check is on, the exit keeps working.'
M_en_EGRESS_TOFU_VERIFIED_NAME='Key without a certificate check (%s): the server’s certificate is issued for %s and checks out against the trusted roots — the check by that name is on, the exit keeps working.'
M_en_EGRESS_TOFU_GAVE_UP='Key without a certificate check (%s): the server hasn’t answered for 7 days — no more tries, the exit doesn’t work. Update the key or the subscription: it needs a link with the pcs fingerprint.'
M_en_EGRESS_W_VLESS_TOFU_WAIT='Key #%s: VLESS without a certificate check (allowInsecure) — the server didn’t answer during the update, the exit doesn’t work yet. Kaskad will try again by itself, at most once an hour (for up to 7 days).'
M_en_EGRESS_W_VLESS_BAD_PIN='Key #%s: the certificate fingerprint (pcs) isn’t a SHA-256. Remove it and add the link again.'
M_en_EGRESS_W_XRAY_REFUSED='Key #%s: this version of xray doesn’t accept it, with its new parameters or without them — the exit is off, the other keys work. The same link won’t help — ask whoever issued the key for a new link.'
M_en_EGRESS_W_XRAY_LEGACY='Key #%s: xray didn’t accept its new parameters (fm, extra, ech, pqv or VLESS encryption) — the key is built without them, as in 3.3.5.'
M_en_EGRESS_W_XRAY_EXT='Key #%s: added before xray was installed; xray has now checked it — the key works with all its parameters (fm, extra, ech, pqv or VLESS encryption).'
M_en_EGRESS_W_VLESS_BAD_LINK='Key #%s: the key couldn’t be read (no server address or port, no password, or something not supported) — the exit doesn’t work. Remove it and add the key again.'
M_en_EGRESS_W_AWG_BAD_ADDR='Key #%s: the client address in the AmneziaWG key is outside private networks or taken by a network of this server — the exit doesn’t work. The key won’t do, ask for a new one.'
M_en_EGRESS_W_AWG_GW_NET='Key #%s: the client address %s falls within the gateway network of this server %s — the exit doesn’t work. Move the gateway of one of the servers to another network (in the panel: Settings › Gateway › Gateway network); the devices of the gateway you move will need new keys.'
M_en_EGRESS_W_AWG_SELF_EP='Key #%s: the server address in the key points to this server — the exit doesn’t work. The key won’t do, ask for a new one.'
M_en_EGRESS_W_KEY_NO_TLS='Key #%s: it has no TLS and the server is at a public address (the password would travel in clear text) — the exit doesn’t work. It needs a link with TLS.'
M_en_EGRESS_W_KEY_WEAK_CIPHER='Key #%s: no encryption or a weak cipher (Shadowsocks none/plain, VMess none/zero) — xray won’t accept it, the exit doesn’t work. It needs a key with encryption.'
M_en_EGRESS_W_KEY_DUP_ENDPOINT='Key #%s: another Hysteria2 key already uses this server address and port — the exit doesn’t work. Remove the extra key.'
M_en_EGRESS_W_KEY_UNSUPPORTED='Key #%s: this protocol isn’t supported here — the exit doesn’t work. It needs a VLESS, Hysteria2, Shadowsocks, Trojan, VMess or AmneziaWG key.'
M_en_EGRESS_W_KEY_XRAY_UNCHECKED='Key #%s: xray didn’t answer in time, the key wasn’t checked — the exit doesn’t work yet. Try again a bit later.'
M_en_EGRESS_W_KEY_OTHER='Key #%s: the key won’t do — the exit doesn’t work. Remove it and add the key again.'
M_en_EGRESS_W_LOST3X='Key #%s: AmneziaWG 3.x key added by an old Kaskad version without the 3.x fields — it won’t connect. Delete it and add it again.'
M_en_EGRESS_W_NEED31='Key #%s: AmneziaWG 3.1 won’t connect — it needs the 3.1 core. GitHub key: menu 8 → 6, then open this screen again.'
